{
  "name": "path-symlink-outside",
  "about": "默认模式下，工作区（PILOT_HOME）里的目录 / 文件符号链接指向工作区外（proj/outside），以及 .. 与大小写变体，经 read_file / write_file / edit_file / send_attachment 访问。基线的路径检查（pathSafety.ts:14-107）是字面的，只有 mustExist（读、发附件）才比对 realpath：读类工具对链接报 permission_denied「resolves outside」；write_file / edit_file 字面在工作区内即通过，新文件经目录链接写出去时由默认模式的权限询问把关（第 3 轮拒绝、第 10 轮允许后真的写到了工作区外），已存在的链接目标没读过则报「File has not been read yet」。第 1 轮在 bypassPermissions 下用 bash 搭链接；除第 10 轮外采集器对任何权限询问一律拒绝。",
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Tool run\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-10-after-tool",
      "when": [
        "turn-10:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_bbx_10\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Done 10."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-10",
      "when": [
        "turn-10:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_bbx_10",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "{PILOT_HOME}/link-out/allowed.txt",
            "content": "written through dir link after allow\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-9-after-tool",
      "when": [
        "turn-9:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_bbx_9\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Done 9."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "turn-9",
      "when": [
        "turn-9:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_bbx_9",
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "{PILOT_HOME}/LINK-OUT/secret.txt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
